WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 e356df7bcabc2d9e377cede51ea7aaa5

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.200
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa, tulipounda variable,

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.100
tumeweka thamani kwenye masanduku na

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.059
kuzitoa baadaye. Hilo limekuwa msaada mkubwa kwa

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.080
kuongeza uwazi kwenye msimbo wetu na kwa kupunguza

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.520
hesabu za kiakili ambazo

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:18.720
tungelazimika kufanya. Lakini thamani halisi

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.940
ya variable inatokana na uwezo wa kubadilisha

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.760
kilicho ndani ya sanduku, kilicho ndani ya variable,

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.710
katika kipindi chote cha programu. Hivyo hata tukiendesha

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:30.120
sehemu hiyo hiyo ya msimbo mara nyingi,

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.900
kile inachofanya kinaweza kubadilika kutegemea

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:38.540
kilicho ndani ya masanduku. Tuseme tunataka kupanda

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.020
ua kwenye bustani. Tuna kitendakazi cha plant (panda)

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:44.340
kinachotumika kirahisi, chenye ingizo moja

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:46.060
kwa nafasi tunayotaka kuweka

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.380
ua. Hivyo tukitaka kuweka ua

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.010
umbali wa 10 kutoka ukingoni, tunaandika plant(10)

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:55.880
Rahisi na wazi. Je, kama

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:59.340
tunataka kupanda maua manane? Tunaweza

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:02.210
kuandika plant(10), plant(20), plant(30),

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:06.780
n.k., lakini hiyo ni kazi ya kuchosha sana. Na tumekwisha

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:10.350
jifunza kuhusu kitu kinachotusaidia kuchukua nafasi ya

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:13.120
msimbo wa kuchosha kama huu. Natumaini ubongo wako

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.640
unazunguka na kupiga kelele, "Tumia kitanzi! Tumia

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:19.440
kizuizi cha repeat!" Na hiyo ni sahihi kabisa. Hivyo

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.120
hebu tuweke position kuwa 10, kisha

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.200
tuwe na kizuizi cha repeat ambapo tunaita

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:27.350
plant, tunatumia kitendakazi cha plant, mara nane.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:32.160
Unafikiri nini kitatokea? Kwa kweli,

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:35.180
kitapanda maua manane, lakini kitayapanda

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.000
mahali pamoja kila mara, jambo ambalo

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:41.140
si kweli tunalotaka. Hivyo hebu

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.960
tuchukue muda kufikiri kuhusu anachofanya

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.420
Jiki hapa. Anatengeneza sanduku lenye

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:47.600
lebo ya position. Anaweka 10 ndani yake.

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:50.330
Kisha anaendesha mashine ya plant mara nane.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.380
Kila mara, anatoa thamani kutoka

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.730
sanduku la position. Daima ni 10, na

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.340
anaweka hiyo 10 hiyo hiyo kila mara. Hivyo

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:03.400
tunachohitaji ni njia ya kusonga

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:06.490
mbele kidogo kila mara. Baada ya

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:08.820
kupanda ua, tunataka kumwambia Jiki

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:12.200
asogeze position mbele kwa 10, tayari kwa

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:16.410
kupanda ua linalofuata. Hivyo, tukisahau

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.800
msimbo kwa muda, ni vipi tungefanya

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:22.360
hivi kimantiki? Kama nikikuambia,

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.460
"Panda ua la kwanza kwenye 10,

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:26.320
kisha linalofuata kwenye 20, kisha linalofuata

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:29.140
kwenye 30," ubongo wako unajuaje kwamba

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:31.549
lifuatalo linapaswa kupandwa kwenye 40

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.940
na lile baada ya hapo linapaswa kupandwa

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:38.280
kwenye 50? Unachofanya ubongo wako ni

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.680
kufuatilia namba ya sasa na kuiongeza

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:44.380
10, kisha kusasisha namba hiyo

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:47.510
akilini mwako. Na tunaweza kufanya

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.950
kitu kile kile kwenye msimbo. Kufanya hivi,

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:54.380
tunasema, "Sasisha (update kwa Kiingereza) sanduku la position

00:02:54.440 --> 00:03:00.500
liwe na thamani ya sasa ya position pamoja na 10."

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:03.040
Jiki anapoona hili, atatoa namba ya sasa

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.460
kutoka sanduku la position, aiongeze 10,

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.570
afanye hiyo hesabu, kuzijumlisha, kisha

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.720
arudishe matokeo kwenye sanduku

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:14.000
kwa ajili ya mara inayofuata. Kwa hivyo tukiongeza hili

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:15.960
kwenye programu yetu, hivyo kwamba sasa tunasema,

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:18.680
"Weka thamani ya awali ya position

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:21.490
kuwa 10," kisha mara nane panda ua

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.860
kwenye position, na kisha badilisha position

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:28.360
iwe kubwa kwa 10 kuliko ilivyokuwa, msimbo wetu

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.640
unafanya kazi, na tunapata maua manane yenye nafasi kati yao.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.400
Angalia kwamba hakuna let (tengeneza variable mpya)

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.980
tunaposasisha variable. Hilo ni muhimu sana. Jiki anapoona

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:42.400
let, anatengeneza sanduku jipya. Lakini hapa,

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:44.560
hatutaki kutengeneza sanduku jipya.

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.480
Tunataka kubadilisha kilicho ndani ya sanduku

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:50.920
ambalo tunalo tayari. Pia angalia kwamba

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:54.320
tunatengeneza sanduku mara moja tu nje ya

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:57.500
kitanzi. Hilo ni muhimu kulikumbuka. Tengeneza sanduku

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.720
mara moja mwanzoni, kisha usasishe

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.500
kila kitanzi kinapoendesha. Sawa. Tumejifunza

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.850
mambo mengi kwenye video hii. Tunaweza

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:08.020
kusasisha kilicho ndani ya masanduku, na tunaweza kutumia

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.880
uwezo huo kufuatilia kitu kinachobadilika

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:14.320
kadri muda unavyopita. Utautumia mtindo huu kila wakati,

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.300
kufuatilia nafasi, kuhesabu mara ngapi kitu

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:21.240
kimetokea, kuweka alama. Wakati wowote unapohitaji kukumbuka

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:24.780
kitu kinachobadilika wakati programu yako inaendesha,

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.520
hivi ndivyo unavyofanya. Kutakuwa na

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.460
mazoezi kadhaa yanayokuja sasa ambayo

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:32.060
yatakusaidia kujizoeza hili. Jisikie huru kurudi

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.760
kwenye video hii ukikwama.

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:36.420
Hilo si kudanganya. Mada hii inaweza kuonekana

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.830
ngumu kiasi. Itaeleweka, lakini mwanzoni,

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:40.510
inaweza kuonekana kuwa nzito kidogo. Na

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:41.930
natumaini, nitakapokuona tena baada ya

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:44.510
mazoezi mawili hivi, utakuwa umeanza

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.090
kuuzoea mtindo huu kidogo

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.600
zaidi na kujiamini kwako kutakuwa kunaongezeka. Kila

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:48.800
la heri.
